{"id":"m68814:solution:fs-idp11620000","rulings":["heat","product","soluble"],"maxOps":15,"en":"(a) [[i:K]][[sub:sp]] = [Mg[[sup:2+]]][F[[sup:–]]][[sup:2]] = (1.21 [[MATH:43]] 10[[sup:–3]])(2 [[MATH:44]] 1.21 [[MATH:45]] 10[[sup:–3]])[[sup:2]] = 7.09 [[MATH:46]] 10[[sup:–9]][[BR]] (b) 7.09 [[MATH:47]] 10[[sup:–7]] [[i:M]][[BR]] (c) Determine the concentration of Mg[[sup:2+]] and F[[sup:–]] that will be present in the final volume. Compare the value of the ion product [Mg[[sup:2+]]][F[[sup:–]]][[sup:2]] with [[i:K]][[sub:sp]]. If this value is larger than [[i:K]][[sub:sp]], precipitation will occur. [[BR]] 0.1000 L [[MATH:48]] 3.00 [[MATH:49]] 10[[sup:–3]] [[i:M]] Mg(NO[[sub:3]])[[sub:2]] = 0.3000 L [[MATH:50]] [[i:M]] Mg(NO[[sub:3]])[[sub:2]][[BR]] [[i:M]] Mg(NO[[sub:3]])[[sub:2]] = 1.00 [[MATH:51]] 10[[sup:–3]] [[i:M]][[BR]] 0.2000 L [[MATH:52]] 2.00 [[MATH:53]] 10[[sup:–3]] [[i:M]] NaF = 0.3000 L [[MATH:54]] [[i:M]] NaF[[BR]] [[i:M]] NaF = 1.33 [[MATH:55]] 10[[sup:–3]] [[i:M]][[BR]] ion product = (1.00 [[MATH:56]] 10[[sup:–3]])(1.33 [[MATH:57]] 10[[sup:–3]])[[sup:2]] = 1.77 [[MATH:58]] 10[[sup:–9]] This value is smaller than [[i:K]][[sub:sp]], so no precipitation will occur.[[BR]] (d) MgF[[sub:2]] is less soluble at 27 °C than at 18 °C. Because added heat acts like an added reagent, when it appears on the product side, the Le Châtelier’s principle states that the equilibrium will shift to the reactants’ side to counter the stress. Consequently, less reagent will dissolve. This situation is found in our case. Therefore, the reaction is exothermic.","is":"(a) [[i:K]][[sub:sp]] = [Mg[[sup:2+]]][F[[sup:–]]][[sup:2]] = (1,21 [[MATH:43]] 10[[sup:–3]])(2 [[MATH:44]] 1,21 [[MATH:45]] 10[[sup:–3]])[[sup:2]] = 7,09 [[MATH:46]] 10[[sup:–9]][[BR]] (b) 7,09 [[MATH:47]] 10[[sup:–7]] [[i:M]][[BR]] (c) Ákvarðið styrk Mg[[sup:2+]] og F[[sup:–]] sem verður til staðar í lokarúmmálinu. Berið saman gildi jónamargfeldisins [Mg[[sup:2+]]][F[[sup:–]]][[sup:2]] við [[i:K]][[sub:sp]]. Ef þetta gildi er stærra en [[i:K]][[sub:sp]] verður botnfall. [[BR]] 0,1000 L [[MATH:48]] 3,00 [[MATH:49]] 10[[sup:–3]] [[i:M]] Mg(NO[[sub:3]])[[sub:2]] = 0,3000 L [[MATH:50]] [[i:M]] Mg(NO[[sub:3]])[[sub:2]][[BR]] [[i:M]] Mg(NO[[sub:3]])[[sub:2]] = 1,00 [[MATH:51]] 10[[sup:–3]] [[i:M]][[BR]] 0,2000 L [[MATH:52]] 2,00 [[MATH:53]] 10[[sup:–3]] [[i:M]] NaF = 0,3000 L [[MATH:54]] [[i:M]] NaF[[BR]] [[i:M]] NaF = 1,33 [[MATH:55]] 10[[sup:–3]] [[i:M]][[BR]] jónamargfeldi = (1,00 [[MATH:56]] 10[[sup:–3]])(1,33 [[MATH:57]] 10[[sup:–3]])[[sup:2]] = 1,77 [[MATH:58]] 10[[sup:–9]] Þetta gildi er minna en [[i:K]][[sub:sp]], þannig að ekkert botnfall verður.[[BR]] (d) MgF[[sub:2]] er minna leysanlegt við 27 °C en við 18 °C. Þar sem viðbættur hiti virkar eins og viðbætt hvarfefni, þegar hann birtist á myndefnamegin, segir lögmál Le Châteliers að jafnvægið muni færast yfir á hvarfefnamegin til að vinna gegn álaginu. Þar af leiðandi leysist minna hvarfefni upp. Þetta ástand er til staðar í okkar tilfelli. Þess vegna er hvarfið útvermið."},
